# The root `.gitignore` ends `*.png`, which would otherwise hide the placeholder window icon.
# `generate_context!` hard-requires `icons/icon.png` on every non-Windows target
# (`tauri-codegen-2.7.1/src/context.rs:211-226`), so the file must be in the tree for the host to
# build at all; a negation scoped to this crate keeps the repo-wide rule intact.
!icons/icon.png
